nut: NUT - Network UPS Tools (a collection of ups tools)
nut:
nut: The Network UPS Tools is a collection of programs which provide a
nut: common interface for monitoring and administering UPS hardware. It
nut: uses a layered approach to connect all the components. Drivers are
nut: provided for a wide assortment of equipment.
nut:
nut: Built from networkupstools/nut master commit 1c4ab78c6 (post-2.8.5)
nut: against Unraid 7.3.4 by github.com/andrebrait/NUT-unRAID CI.
nut: Provided for use on Unraid WITHOUT ANY WARRANTIES.
